My investigation revealed:
- ReturnStatement uses `'__CONTROL_PLACEHOLDER__'` (implemented after pattern was established)
- VariableDeclaration and Assignment use `$current_control` directly (implemented before pattern)
- This is an architectural inconsistency bug

## User Message 4: "just because we implemented a bug doesnt mean we should leave that bug till future iterations"
