2. Documented that SPPF creates both nodes (incomplete and complete)
3. Created issue #78 for IR optimization pass
4. Closed issue #77 (was "parser bug", actually expected behavior)

## User Message 6: "theh semiring should pick the longer parse rather than the first parse"
